  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Private Partnership (PPP) workshops Rwanda and Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A PPP workshop for essential stakeholders in the horticulture sector in Rwanda will be organised in Rwanda at the start of 2018. The next step after this project is a PPP mission to the Netherlands during the Greentech fair in the Netherlands in June 2018. It is best to tailor a programme for PPP missions to the Netherlands by identifying the most relevant topics to discuss and the specific needs of partners.</narrative>
  </description>
